  m_Name: Desert_0-Meeting at desert galaxy
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: T.I.I.G.E.R
  paragraphs:
  - "Hmm. Against the odds, you\u2019ve made it this far. We expected you to fail
    during the last hole.\r"
  - However, I must inform you that the Milky Way is a beginner-level course in comparison
    to others in our portfolio.
  - "Now, for a real test. This galaxy is riddled with moons. A single misstep, and
    you\u2019ll be sent into deep space."
